.TH PSGetCodeOptimizationLevel 3 2023-12-07 "PsyC 0.9.3" "PsyC Library Functions Manual"

.SH NAME
PSGetCodeOptimizationLevel

.SH LIBRARY
PsyC (-lpsyc)

.SH SYNOPSIS

.B
#include <psyc/config.h>

.I
int  
.br
\fBPSGetCodeOptimizationLevel\fR(\fIvoid\fR)
.SH DESCRIPTION
Returns code optimization level (given by -O gcc option) as an integer.
.br
Returns -1 if optimization level is unknown.
